#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Katsuura"
msgid "Get back... I'm warning you!"
msgstr "¡Atrás...! ¡Te lo advierto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Tanimura"
msgid "Look, even if you do shoot me, my friends are clued in to\\r\neverything. They'll hunt you down and bring you to justice."
msgstr "Aunque me mates, mis amigos ya están al tanto de todo.\\r\nTe cazarán y te harán pagar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Katsuura"
msgid "Kaga, that bastard... Made it seem like he was under my\\r\nthumb, and then had to go investigate me behind my back..."
msgstr "Kaga, ese bastardo... Fingía trabajar para mí, pero en realidad\\r\nme estaba investigando a mis espaldas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Tanimura"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Katsuura"
msgid "In my world, there's no worse threat than someone who can't be bought."
msgstr "No hay nada que me asuste más que alguien que no se deja comprar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Tanimura"
msgid "And you killed him just for that?"
msgstr "¿Y por eso lo mataste?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Katsuura"
msgid "He got killed because he was stupid. Instead of saving his\\r\nown hide, he let himself get caught by me, all to protect\\r\nthat woman and her kid."
msgstr "Murió por estúpido. En vez de salvarse el pellejo, se entregó\\r\na mí, todo por proteger a esa mujer y a su hijo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Tanimura"
msgid "Kaga had a child?"
msgstr "¿Kaga tenía un hijo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Katsuura"
msgid "Yeah... with that Thai woman he fell in love with."
msgstr "Sí... con esa tailandesa de la que se enamoró."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Katsuura"
msgid "After she discovered what our organization was really all\\r\nabout, I tried to have her silenced."
msgstr "Después de que descubrió los secretos de nuestra organización,\\r\nintenté silenciarla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Katsuura"
msgid "But she fled back to Thailand after having her baby here.\\r\nSo I planned to use her baby as bait to lure her back to\\r\nJapan..."
msgstr "Pero la muy puta huyó a Tailandia después de parir aquí.\\r\nAsí que planeé usar a su hijo como carnada para atraerla\\r\nde vuelta a Japón..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Katsuura"
msgid "Then I found out Kaga hid the baby somewhere."
msgstr "Ahí me enteré que Kaga había escondido al bebé en algún lado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Tanimura"
msgid "He \"hid\" the baby?"
msgstr "¿'Escondió' al bebé?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Katsuura"
msgid "He probably placed the baby in someone else's care. I never heard about the brat after that."
msgstr "Seguramente dejó al bebé al cuidado de alguien más. Después de eso, nunca más supe del mocoso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Tanimura"
msgid "So his child grew up without knowing him... or where they came from."
msgstr "Así que su hijo creció sin conocerlo... ni siquiera sabiendo de dónde venía."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Katsuura"
msgid "If Kaga hadn't tried to protect his woman and his kid,\\r\nhe would've had me by the throat eventually."
msgstr "Si Kaga no se hubiera empeñado en proteger a su mujer y su\\r\nhijo... tarde o temprano me habría tenido contra las cuerdas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Katsuura"
msgid "He was one of the few men I truly feared... I'll give him\\r\nthat. Matter of fact... you're the spitting image of him...\\r\nOr is that just a coincidence?"
msgstr "Fue uno de los pocos hombres que de verdad me hizo temer...\\r\nTengo que reconocerlo. De hecho... eres igualito a él...\\r\n¿O será solo coincidencia?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Tanimura"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

